    "summary": "This model begins the battle in Reserves, and neither it nor any unit embarked in it counts toward any limit on how many units can start in Reserves.\n\nIt can arrive during the Reinforcements step of any of your first 3 Movement phases, whatever the mission rules say. When it does:\n\n- Every unit embarked in it must disembark at once, placed more than 8\" from all enemy models.\n- No unit can embark in it for the rest of the battle.",
